<view class="page">
  <view class="page-title">数据统计</view>
  <view class="stats-filters"><picker mode="selector" range="{{exerciseOptions}}" value="{{exerciseIndex}}" bindchange="onExerciseChange"><view class="field-input">{{exerciseOptions[exerciseIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><picker mode="selector" range="{{periodOptions}}" value="{{periodIndex}}" bindchange="onPeriodChange"><view class="field-input">{{periodOptions[periodIndex]}} ▾</view></picker></view>
  <view wx:if="{{warning}}" class="opt-warning">{{warning}}</view>
  <block wx:if="{{stats}}">
    <view class="muted spaced">{{stats.rangeLabel}} · 按记录开始时的本地日期统计</view>
    <view class="stats-grid"><view class="card stat"><view class="muted">训练总量</view><view class="stat-value">{{stats.volume}} <text>{{stats.unit}}</text></view></view><view class="card stat"><view class="muted">训练次数</view><view class="stat-value">{{stats.sessions}} <text>次训练</text></view></view><view class="card stat"><view class="muted">实际训练时间</view><view class="stat-value stat-time">{{stats.elapsed}}</view></view><view class="card stat"><view class="muted">训练天数</view><view class="stat-value">{{stats.days}} <text>天</text></view></view></view>
    <view class="card spaced"><view class="section-title">周月总量</view><view class="plan-row"><text>本周（周一起）</text><text>{{stats.weekVolume}} {{stats.unit}}</text></view><view class="plan-row"><text>本月</text><text>{{stats.monthVolume}} {{stats.unit}}</text></view><view class="plan-row"><text>当前连续 / 历史最长</text><text>{{stats.currentStreak}} / {{stats.longestStreak}} 天</text></view><view class="muted spaced">连续天数只作记录，不要求每天高强度训练；恢复日仍按个人计划安排。</view></view>
    <view class="card spaced"><view class="section-title">每日训练量变化</view><view class="muted">最近最多14天 · 单位 {{stats.unit}} · 横滑查看</view><view class="chart"><view wx:for="{{stats.daily}}" wx:key="date" class="chart-column" aria-label="{{item.date + ' 完成 ' + item.value + stats.unit}}"><view class="bar-track"><view class="bar" style="height: {{item.height}}%;"></view></view><text class="bar-value">{{item.value}}</text><text class="bar-date">{{item.label}}</text></view></view></view>
    <view class="card spaced"><view class="section-title">五组计划完成率</view><view class="stat-value">{{stats.planCompletion}}</view><view class="muted">已完成 {{stats.completedPlans}} / {{stats.planSessions}} 次五组计划；总量完成率按计划目标加权，每次最多计100%，跳过和提前结束不会视为完成。</view></view>
    <view class="card spaced"><view class="section-title">历史最好成绩</view><view class="plan-row"><text>单组最高</text><text>{{stats.bestSet}} {{stats.unit}}</text></view><view class="plan-row"><text>单次训练总量最高</text><text>{{stats.bestSession}} {{stats.unit}}</text></view><view class="plan-row"><text>最近能力评估</text><text>{{stats.ability}} {{stats.unit}}</text></view><view class="muted spaced">最好成绩包含已保存的训练和测试，次数与计时分运动展示。</view></view>
    <view class="card spaced"><view class="section-title">能力成长记录</view><view wx:if="{{!stats.events.length}}" class="muted spaced">完成能力测试或手动评估后显示。旧版本只能补充已保存的最近能力，无法还原更早评估。</view><view wx:for="{{stats.events}}" wx:key="id" class="ability-event"><view class="ability-row"><view><text>{{item.date}}</text><view class="muted">{{item.source}}</view></view><text>{{item.maximum}} {{stats.unit}}</text></view><view class="ability-track"><view class="ability-bar" style="width: {{item.width}}%;"></view></view></view><view class="muted spaced">显示最近12次评估；训练量增加不代表最大能力一定增长。</view></view>
  </block>
  <navigator class="button button-secondary spaced" url="/pages/history/index" open-type="switchTab">查看训练记录</navigator>
</view>
